<view class="wrap"><view class="eyebrow">CXY / INTELLIGENCE</view><view class="hero">从课堂出发，<view>看见产业的下一步。</view></view><view class="row"><text class="muted">{{updated ? updated + ' 更新' : '等待首次采集'}} · {{count}} 条精选</text><text class="tag" bindtap="saved">{{savedOnly ? '查看全部' : '我的收藏'}}</text></view><view class="tabs"><view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" class="tab {{category===item.id?'active':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="tab">{{item.name}}</view></view><input placeholder="搜索技术、竞赛、产业动态" bindinput="search"/><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载情报…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重新连接</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row"><text class="tag">{{item.categoryLabel}}</text><text class="muted">价值 {{item.score}} / 10</text></view><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="summary">{{item.summary}}</view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:24rpx">{{item.source}} · {{item.date}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!visible.length}}" class="empty">暂无符合条件的情报<view class="muted">采集后会自动展示真实来源内容</view></view></block><view class="muted">依据人工维护关键词筛选 · AI 辅助整合，请结合原文核实</view></view>
